        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: White Nights (1985 film)\n- People: Taylor Hackford, Twyla Tharp, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, Isabella Rossellini\n- Roles: director, choreographer, dancer, actor, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Gregory Hines was born as Gregory Oliver Hines on February 14, 1946, and he died on August 9, 2003.\n- Gregory Hines was an American dancer, actor, singer, and choreographer.\n- White Nights is a 1985 American drama film.\n- White Nights was directed by Taylor Hackford.\n- White Nights was choreographed by Twyla Tharp.\n- White Nights stars Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, and Isabella Rossellini.",
